# Shared VHS settings; each clip tape Sources this. Run tapes from the repository root.
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1920
Set Height 1080
Set Padding 24
Set TypingSpeed 15ms
Set Theme "GitHub Dark"
Set WaitTimeout 20m
Set WaitPattern /aaia\$/

Hide
Type `source video/tapes/env.sh; clear` Enter
Sleep 1s
Show
